comments.text:
@mkpa69420 The script sends random data to all remotes, and it looks like you were in a map that has a remote programmed to kill the player when triggered.
This is not a bug in the script — it's because the remote itself is linked to a death function.
The script doesn't filter or skip any remotes, so this behavior is expected.

scripts.script:
local s = {
{"15312911732", "14532583477", "14532583469", "14532583517", "14532583483", "134082579"}
}
game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage"):WaitForChild("Remotes"):WaitForChild("ChangeCharacterBody"):InvokeServer(unpack(s))
